{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-45","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2016,"subject":"physics","number":45,"points":1.5,"unitId":"physics-modern","unitLabel":"현대물리","topic":"퍼텐셜우물·파동함수","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["physics-modern"],"stem":"그림은 1차원 퍼텐셜 우물과 바닥상태에 있는 전자의 파동 함수 \n를 나타낸 것이다. 퍼텐셜 에너지 V는 |x|≦L일 때 0이고, \n|x|>L일 때 V0이다. 전자의 에너지는 E(<V0)이다.\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n[1.5점]\n<보 기>\nㄱ. |x|>L에서 전자를 발견할 확률은 0이다.\nㄴ. V0이 클수록 |x|≦L에서 전자를 발견할 확률은 커진다.\nㄷ. V0이 무한대일 경우, E=0이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t010"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]}],"answer":2,"acceptedAnswers":[2],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":14,"height":23,"region":0,"bbox":[63.9,5.303,5.6,9.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-45/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":717,"height":82,"region":0,"bbox":[15.1,22.903,286.8,32.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t002","t003"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-45/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":357,"height":262,"region":0,"bbox":[98.3,70.103,142.8,104.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-45/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":771,"height":186,"region":0,"bbox":[14.7,235.303,308.4,74.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-45/04.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":24,"sourceRect":[82.9,153.497,417.0,512.542],"width":334.1,"height":359.045,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","